<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard rescued 22 people from a distressed boat off Palawan while the Philippine Air Force led a coastal cleanup on Panampangan Island in Tawi-Tawi, promoting sustainable tourism. A 28‑year-old man was killed and his younger brother was the attacker in a stabbing in Ozamiz City, and a driver was killed and a female passenger wounded in a gas-station shooting in BARMM’s SGA. Joint naval exercises involving the Philippines and France tested operational capabilities, and the Philippines and Japan added five new Coast Guard vessels to their maritime security cooperation. Finland and the Philippines signed a maritime security pact that includes Australian assistance for drones and cybersecurity. 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/china-asean-countries-struggle-over-south-china-sea-code-of-conduct/a-80009799?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSGRPTHNGcXhIZmZ1Vm5SWElQNG1Ddjk1QWZ6dVFqVWd2OVZneHFjSDI0NlpIOXN6U21KOWwxd1p5UkxVbnRYcnNOT1FQcDBNY2hYT05qMXd0WHF3Z29ZbGtOYzdGMDBVYTBDMTB0Yzd4cXQ4aHY2MlZQWWRCeWpZLUxmY2xvaTc2OGtfZnVMOWVLN0NYd2tXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punto! Central Luzon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNUjZVeUZIMkNKYVZZeG5tWk5yVlJ4X1VqQUFzRF9uaXZRc3ZicHJ6VHFlbkZvN3ZGSmc4aWpSZmJtRkdidE42Z1pFd2Q2bk1ZRE9peG9DN3dkTVRYUmVWZ3hWbGRyU3pXZXdoTGVTSGpjZmk1djZrekxTdTMtdVZ5VmJtRVpzVmhlQWVwTllFLVlGZE9nTWRtQmlxUzdTSmdlbzNpS2ZCX2JwUjlvb21TX3g2MDR3LVRRU1RpUjd4YVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt